[312.262513, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m● belay\u001b[0m\r\n  **August locked in.** Final numbers:\r\n\r\n  | | |\r\n  |---|---|\r\n  | income | €2,800.00 |\r\n  | car | €72.56 |\r\n  | groceries | €306.15 |\r\n  | dining_out | €237.96 (€37.96 baseline + €200 coast trip, mid-Aug) |\r\n  | subscriptions | €25.78 |\r\n  | **savings target** | **€2,157.55** |\r\n\r\n  The trip is filed under `dining_out` as a separate overlay line (source: user) rather than blended into the baseline — no dedicated travel category exists, and this way it won't skew future dining averages once actuals land. Say the word if you'd rather it sit somewhere else.\r\n\r\n  Workspace validated clean, Excel exported — no envelope transfers needed since you're in awareness mode, just visibility.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
